 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting(7)': the Objective, Prepared Defenses, Imperial Arrest Order, Mobilization Points, There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement (the strategy calls it the default third Effect), Yavin 4 Swamp and Yavin 4. These count toward the 60; several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set. Total 60 as published.",
  "There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement is listed both under Starting and under Effects(9) (both header counts include it), so two copies are in the 60; dested as posted.",
  "Posted 'Yavin 4 Swamp' dested the generic Special Edition site Swamp (no Yavin 4: Swamp exists); 'Hoth Ice Plains' Hoth: Ice Plains (5th Marker); 'Desert' and 'Jungle' the generic Special Edition sites.",
  "Posted 'Captain Gilead Pealleon' dested Captain Gilad Pellaeon; 'Presense of the Force' Presence Of The Force; 'Bossk in Hounds Tooth' Bossk In Hound's Tooth; Secret Plans and Battle Order are the pre-Reflections III Effects.",
  "Title 'v 2 0' is DeckTech's rendering of 'v 2.0'; the post is a revision of an earlier Imperial Occupation list."
